{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:26:40.357769+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c0cf16ae6466abc66477afa8a7ad7d63837b00c1b3fca78a6cbe14c70c89023e","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 19 of arXiv:2511.09280, 'Random Walk conditioned to stay above a non-flat floor: curvature effects'] For any \(1\leq k\leq n/2\), \(a> 0\),
