where $a_n$ and $c_n=\{a_n\}$ are given by \eqref{bt}--\eqref{bc}, and
 $\qx_j$ introduced above is  a continuous, $1$-periodic function,   representable  by the
Fourier series
\begin{align}
  \qx_j(u) =
