{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:20:33.750175+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c19de2d4ffde3d6bf8621e6e6956ae4463ef0ff1ae8a920e850b7c2febfbb8e9","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary 12 of arXiv:2608.18834, 'The Parabolic Anderson Model's Total Mass at Small Times: Geometry, Fluctuations, and Reno'] Suppose that Assumption \ref{Assumption} holds,
and let $\ka>0$.
\begin{enumerate}
