{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T05:53:54.855544+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c1b3eeb957404c4d9aaaf5aa721fdfa7808569f96e6f728186d93e58c399569b","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 11 of arXiv:2607.16954, 'Repeated differentiation of deterministic polynomials with asymptotically radial root dist'] With the notation introduced above, we have that
\begin{equation}

