{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:29:00.770814+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c1e40b0646ca8c5fda41073ce8c90c3947800c350b96a7609f0dfee235b889c1","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 9 of arXiv:2512.05340, 'The rate of convergence of the critical mean-field $O(N)$ magnetization via multivariate n'] Let $V$ satisfy Assumption~\ref{assumption: assumptions on V} and let $\mu$ be the probability measure with Lebesgue density proportional
