{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:55:18.050765+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c1e5245e215cb0e1f38d2b123efe63be00d6fbb6f54e3dd3528201a874f652cc","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 10 of arXiv:2606.16164, 'A Low-Regularity Semigroup Sewing Lemma via Quotient Structures'] Set $\gamma\in(0,1]$, $\alpha\in\mathbb{R}$, and $\tau\in[0,T]$. Let  $h\in Z\hat C^{\gamma}(\Delta_T^3;B_\alpha)$ and define $h^\tau$ by \eqref{eq:frozen-defect}. Then
