{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:50:48.854407+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c25f4c143eaed7363dcbd79bddf43c88010f2fbc04585c21334b793b021a65d5","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem_NN20 of arXiv:2607.11469, 'Breuer-Major-Donsker invariance principle'] Let $(Y_n)_{n\geq 1}$ be a sequence of random elements 
