{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T01:10:08.715013+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c26df2d164a44ece95ab57e4a0b7b51cd024a08d433a4d12b20dc5adbed98535","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary corollary_repl_lemma_ave of arXiv:2411.17653, 'Exclusion processes with non-reversible boundary: hydrodynamics and large deviations'] For any function $H \in C^{1,2}( {\Omega_T})$and for every $\delta > 0$, it holds that
