{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:50:48.854535+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c276dabdeaf5b2240069560364b701e684f053e7928e2c965a4329f8144fc785","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem_2a of arXiv:2607.11469, 'Breuer-Major-Donsker invariance principle'] Let $\mathbf G$ have an absolutely continuous spectral measure with density
