{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T22:38:08.415037+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c27c2145e118dcef5190a4bc3d21a313fe044d20037f24493312402aa1c4be94","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma eq: normsq of J_1 of arXiv:2609.02073, 'Existence of closed non-planar $p$-elasticae'] The vector field
