{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:20:15.485686+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c29c4f269302c1b190d055f5e3b8fcd5c900aac7c51bb0367504bdad218bfc03","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prop 72 of arXiv:2509.01797, 'Relation between Wick powers and excursion clusters of the 2D GFF'] Let $n\in \N$, $n$ odd.
