{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T00:45:32.094984+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c2cfe2e7135a7920b3315ec8089b1f4cf2e9a1f449854a0b3ba6167c3f09eafe","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem divergence RW of arXiv:2411.14350, 'Randomized Geodesic Flow on Hyperbolic Groups'] [Woe93]

