before intersecting either its top or bottom boundaries.","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-09T07:38:10+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c2d3ac9feaa09091756544ea5fd288f96f2484334d879e4c72930c5ea6b59984","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 3.1 of arXiv:2512.19517, 'Spiking and Resetting'] The process $({\bar X}^\varepsilon_t)_{t \ge 0}$ with state space $\{0,1\}$ and c\`adl\`ag  trajectories defined by 
