\end{align*}","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-09-07T12:18:17.977320+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c2f8f12fe017a3a826ffca6ba1b8a30f53b4bfd6990e9b440ae8918320950690","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 5 (\cite{Kac,Pleijel}) of arXiv:2507.06186, '2507.06186'] If $\partial D$ is sufficiently regular (e.g., smooth), then
