{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:54:53.444513+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c33b07f94307bdad0958d322a8d5a45e939e50aa2954b59343eb909332066974","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 15 of arXiv:2606.15432, 'A Concavity Theorem for the Parisi PDE'] For all $(s,x)\in [0,1]\times \R$,
\begin{equation}
