{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:17:17.102966+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c38327e02c2ffc2ef71951ce32b4c64254ce82020742a6ba0dc6715dc3164ba9","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 19 (The transition block) of arXiv:2608.20101, '\bfseries Largest bulk gap of the complex Ginibre ensemble'] Let
