{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:55:18.059007+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c3aa4a1e8ebadf47b8503daa43ef7c9c7921d1f70565ac911e7c6aa1f45855ba","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 49 of arXiv:2606.16636, 'Free energy of non-convex multi-species spin glasses with centered Ising spins'] For every $t\geq0$ and every $q=(q_s)_{s\in\sS}\in\mcl Q_2^\sS$, writing $q^\lambda:=\sum_{s\in\sS}\lambda_s q_s$,
