{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T22:01:01.834089+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c3dbb0e276b0cdea264500de0feb6ef6bba67a598e10f8668d0d8afaae5c62be","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:weighted-energy-detailed of arXiv:2609.00556, 'Higgs--Demailly System and Positivity of Higgs Bundles'] For every $0<\sigma\leq1$, the normalized endomorphisms $H_i$ satisfy
