	\end{equation} holds uniformly over all $u \in \mathcal R^{\eta'}_k(1)$ and $v \in \mathcal R^{\eta'}_k(T)$, where $r_{k,T}$ is as in (equation eq:funcfg of the paper). (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

