{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T10:52:57.678004+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c433371869b4a9ae4e4cb186c6b68717c98f4f8f52ac22854ae5faa90655f7fe","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 11 of arXiv:2609.02699, '\vspace{-0.5 cm}Gauge theory and symplectic structures'] In dimension $6$, on a closed K\"ahler $3$-fold, for any $(A,\beta,\phi)$, we have the inequality
