{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T21:02:38.598011+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c47974f629e50e32239b42da0e83183d5d528c657f99af09485411cebd7fa8c3","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 23 of arXiv:2607.07283, 'Multi-time Markov renewal chains and stratified renewal theorems'] Let $\Lambda$ be a compact subset of $\Delta_I$ and let $k_t:\Lambda\to\N^d$ be Borel and satisfy

