{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T15:27:25.799886+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c4b9370a3b198cf3924d99a0a43a6c9b4ac1053536b351193f215276e6f2d9e3","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition def:hidden-parameter of arXiv:2605.17082, 'Spectral Purification in Reversible Markov Chains: Hidden Parameters, Observable Equivalen'] The \emph{hidden purification parameter} is
