{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:23:05.304648+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c4c4e73881c6d6bd76e751dccb15d36588f0f89880cda8e567a15e21f9de1aba","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 9 of arXiv:2608.21905, '\bf Ruin theory incorporating MIPP-type jumps'] Suppose $c>\lambda^nm$, then
