is Fréchet differentiable with, for any $(\psi,x) \in W_{2}^{1-\alpha}\left(0, T; \mathbb{R}^{m}\right) \times  W_{1}^{\alpha}\left(0, T; \mathbb{R}^{d}\right)$, $\phi \in W_{2}^{1-\alpha}\left(0, T; \mathbb{R}^{m}\right) $ and $y \in W_{1}^{\alpha}\left(0, T; \mathbb{R}^{d}\right)$, for all $1 \leq k \leq d$,
