Furthermore, $\mathcal{D}_2 T (0,x)$ is a linear homeomorphism from $W_{1}^{\alpha}\left(0, T; \mathbb{R}^{d}\right)$ to\\  $C^{1-\alpha}\left(0, T; \mathbb{R}^{d}\right)$ and we have, for any $\varphi \in W_{2}^{1-\alpha}\left(0, T ; \mathbb{R}^{m}\right)$
