{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:21:06.855356+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c5551890549f64b680ef9843b50be74c0f53fca2d75c936ec70f64c6edb4404f","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 11 of arXiv:2608.21014, 'The stochastic Cahn--Hilliard equation in critical spaces'] Under Assumption~\ref{assumption_weakened_setting}, the following hold:
