{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T05:44:27.968984+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c566fc9d41f4292cf924c2b0eb4fbf8beeac5f401418b5cd4ae286c564b6cbc3","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 2 of arXiv:2607.13273, 'Asymptotics of transition densities for L\'evy processes with stochastic resetting'] Let $\boldsymbol{Y}$ be the Brownian motion in $\Rd.$ Then
    for all $\lambda>0, t>0$ the density $p_\lambda$ of the
