{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:58:09.066503+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c5b3258e4e646f76680b54106b1885fcfa5c3f960e2d786c03c5c782ba2b539c","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 8 of arXiv:2606.27520, 'Critical curve of loop percolation on the $d$-regular tree'] Let $\kappa\geq \kappa_c$. For a finite subset of vertices $F$,
