{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:43:55.658183+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c5c258cb988dda45ede213ce80968e253c285f1a85bef672332c62b46169dbcc","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Thm plugin_sharp of arXiv:2604.07183, 'Stopping on the last success with unknown odds: asymptotic minimax optimality of the plug-'] Fix~$p_0\in(0,\frac12)$ and let
