{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T09:36:31.234524+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c5cbdf3345c6714b8e883075fbf7fe7feb2dd310989f8b676b43af86d52c512f","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 16 of arXiv:2609.00567, 'Hodge--Tate splitting and Akizuki--Nakano vanishing in positive characteristic'] Let \(X\) be a stack and let
