{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:58:53.162304+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c5fcffca7c66fc0074e888df85e16eace5950268bfda110d839fe53b6d273889","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 9 of arXiv:2606.29512, '2606.29512'] Let Assumptions \ref{assumption1a}, \ref{assumption2a} 
