    For a general $\mu \in P_{inv}(\mathcal{M}_0)$, by invariance there is $p \in [0,1]$ and $\mu_1, \mu_2 \in P_{inv}(\mathcal{M}_0)$ such that $\mu_1(\{x_k = 0\}) = 1$, $\mu_2(\{x_k = 0\}) = 0$, and $\mu = p\mu_1 + (1-p)\mu_2$. Then we 
