{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:46:26.257035+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c60da31dc98b899c37816118a55ac2462f0219f7fbac0f61c8a5cf48dc0c0973","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Thm 58 of arXiv:2605.23308, 'Convergence rate estimates for semigroups and heat kernels associated with resistance form'] Let $x\in F,x_n\in F_n,\kappa\in [1/2,1],p\in [1,\infty],\alpha\in (0,\alpha_n),t>0$ and $f\in\BL^{\kappa}(M)$.
