    =
    c_n'\operatorname{dist}_{L^2(\mu_n)}(f,\mathcal{H}_n^{\mathrm{div}})^2.
  \end{equation} (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T17:32:11.141708+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c65434d19df640bfd98419aff6b1ef26a3823aa656574369f45e72d2720d1d1b","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thm:KS of arXiv:2510.13572, 'Coalescence in Markov chains'] Let $P=(p_{i,j}:i,j\in S)$.
