        \widetilde{\mathsf{P}}\Big(\mathcal{I}^{(x), u(1-\rho)} \cap Q_R(x) \subset X[0, uN^d] \cap Q_R(\boldsymbol{x}) \subset \mathcal{I}^{(x), u(1+\rho)} \cap Q_R(x) \text{\quad for all } x \in F \Big) \\
