{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T14:49:05.396652+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c6b025418559ef35ae19144d242c917b956606e3c49dcd43a0f43d38fbc1409d","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma eq:cluster_size_independence of arXiv:2601.07808, 'Supercritical long-range percolation on graphs of polynomial growth: the truncated one-arm'] \label[lemma]{prop:cluster_size_independence}
