{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:42:57.241022+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c6b1ab9d4403b66dcb9a37a4c0a388c77713c581f98ea56499cb5784113d05e7","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thm:fixed-shell-minimax of arXiv:2608.20295, 'Physical-Support Confidence Sets for Highly Coherent Dictionaries'] Under Assumption~(ass:frozen-shell of the paper) and the interior compatibility
