 dimension $n\geq 2$. Let $\chi$ be another K\"ahler form.  Suppose that the $J$-semistable condition ~\eqref{topintegralnonnegative}--~\eqref{$J$-semistablecondition} holds. Set the positive constant $$c= \frac{2n\displaystyle\int_M\Big(\chi^n-n\chi^{n-1}\wedge\omega\Big)+\int_M \omega^n}{8n^2\displaystyle\int_M\chi\wedge\omega^{n-1}},$$ and let \begin{equation}
