{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T18:48:24.295533+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c72a6232a906f301f94b8c8a6c60443e33d340ac9543ddd17290a25499ad10d8","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem lucesec of arXiv:2605.10452, 'A secretary for Messrs. Luce and Mallows'] Consider the secretary problem for a
