for any  $\eta\in \{0,1\}^{\{0,\dots,L\}\times \{1,\dots K\}}$, $y_0,\dots,y_L\in\ZZ$ (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

