{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T22:43:19.042607+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c781ec51218483998af86f298fdace9eae5e7e09ca919587be7d17f7c9bfc513","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Thm thm-P2 of arXiv:2609.02552, 'Resolvent Estimates for the Stokes Operator \\ in a Three-Dimensional Lipschitz Domain'] Let $d=3$ and $\lambda\in \Sigma_\theta$.
