{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T16:50:26.966327+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c78b3b14c54e22797a4b73ec5634541a2f22d5f3e1db6e030a47c4ebfaf3f143","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Thm moment theorem 1_intro of arXiv:2505.11700, 'Distribution of the cokernels of determinantal row-sparse matrices'] (Theorem (thm: moment theorem 1 of the paper)) Let $G$ be a finite abelian group. Assume that a sequence $(k_n)_{n=1}^{\infty}$ satisfies the following:
