{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T14:01:56.354567+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c7af72bb2b0161f791510e8df749f3f2ed8692855356f00a26395b57bbecefbc","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary holub-1-Y-reflexive of arXiv:2609.00794, 'On operators whose adjoints or second adjoints attain their norms'] Let $X$ and $Y$ be Banach spaces. 
