{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T22:01:01.832740+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c7b8c149f8e56f9e6b2d3160afce88cdc1708d230c8da809933d3bfff6431d10","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:t0-asymptotics of arXiv:2609.00556, 'Higgs--Demailly System and Positivity of Higgs Bundles'] Fix $\lambda_*>0$.  Uniformly for all $\lambda\geq\lambda_*$ and all
