{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T10:52:57.724503+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c827c1fc339232a2d158adcf4dd77643368b5ebb2ebad5ad2f42c7386bda1f31","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 42 (Batch-size-dependent data scaling) of arXiv:2609.02728, 'Momentum in large-batch training: Polyak enlarges the critical batch size, Nesterov improv'] For \(B=D^{b+o(1)}\) with \(b\in[0,1)\), 
