{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T23:13:49.854375+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c82e0a040b2785a72b440ac164bd097aeb4f0f453a54224a602e5e46672e0db9","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem th:intro of arXiv:2411.06838, 'Generalized Wasserstein Barycenters'] Let $\lambda$ be a signed measure on $\mathcal{P}_2(\mathbb{R})$, satisfying
