{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:25:12.196182+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c86be4d9c5ce186a69bc8af4c63868734bbcd17d409bd3921f2584c1eb4be2ac","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Defi 26 of arXiv:2510.22783, 'Universality of Cutoff for Riffle Shuffling'] We define the following classes of prefixes:
