{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:33:01.765277+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c8b781d91f405ebf775b944da99f9f727e0f61175ae02b73bed8b7e00c7e35a0","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 18 of arXiv:2605.14254, '2605.14254'] Let $X$ be a Feller process with arbitrary initial distribution, and fix any optional time $\tau$. Then these conditions are equivalent:
