{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T12:33:11.957713+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c964de8b8c1829309a9355dfa3ae8ac3115f5270365c996246e74421af9513e1","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma eq:zero-first-moment of arXiv:2607.14087, 'Stochastic Domination of Gaussian Maxima: A Resolution of the Weak Simplex Conjecture'] \label[lemma]{thm:centered-product}
Let $R$ be an $m\times m$ correlation matrix and let $X\sim\mathcal N(0,R)$.  For
