{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T08:52:08.658883+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ca124849c0a5fc42dc44a9c2e30615573002fb5fe5c4e1d929ba41f354ae2212","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 5 of arXiv:2608.29984, 'On Cauchy Problems for Parabolic Equations with Rough Coefficients'] For $1\leq p\leq\infty, k \geq 0$,
