{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:36:04.991902+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ca1dd9e79166fb9f640854da0da5699289f29009efdf689ce89428bbc03229b8","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 3 of arXiv:2604.01257, '2604.01257'] Under the conditions $[{f}_{\nu}]$, $[{\mathcal{L}}_{\nu}]$ and $[{\omega}_{\nu}]$, the following relation holds:
