{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T10:34:20.789205+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ca2cb7afe929ad7c2c793c131260a9deaf9f61fef5bce809e9409464e51422f7","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theo 20 of arXiv:2609.02261, 'Quantization and process'] For any  $\lambda$ and $\mu$ satisfying
