{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:31:20.610802+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ca34b53adc232873b68c4c462c3545b76e2b592bdc81f8b83a52085dbcc5aea7","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 25 of arXiv:2608.25772, 'Propagation of Chaos and Gaussian Fluctuations for Mean-field Coupled Maps'] For any $\varphi\in H^3(\T)$, we have
