{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T08:44:39.737990+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_cabfa0214fd874fdd955f4886da8573344c47b95e7c1ec29c7bd0fa49ae0984a","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 3 ($L^2$ semigroup with bounded potential) of arXiv:2608.29854, '2608.29854'] Assume \eqref{eq:ES}, let $\cV$ be admissible with associated operator
