{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:20:15.484258+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_cadf31f47551116145c76f38537b568c34439ccc1837ea4d221b676768074804","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Cor 53 of arXiv:2509.01797, 'Relation between Wick powers and excursion clusters of the 2D GFF'] Let $\eta>0$, $k\geq 0$, $j\geq 1$, $l\geq 0$, with $j+2l\leq 2k+1$.
