{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:55:37.360588+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_cb89a3d627d4404fc4e21137c69a70162dd810e274f2453c326c0dabb4820fd0","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 20 of arXiv:2606.17859, 'Full $\Gamma-$expansion for the level-two large deviation rate functionals of non-reversib'] For every $0\leq p < \widehat{\mf q}$, the $0-$level set of $\ms J^{(p)}$ is the
