 The conditional probability of $\widetilde{I}_\epsilon$ given $\eta_{w_1;\mathrm{in}}$, $\eta_{w_2;\mathrm{out}}$, $\eta_{w_3;\mathrm{in}}$, $X^0_{0,1},X^0_{0,\epsilon}$, and the values of $h$ on $X^0_{0,1},X^0_{0,\epsilon}$ is at least $p$.
