{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T23:06:42.720653+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ccfbd206b86f278af6be37ca6f3d971afc8627ee492669f6f213064182de70a5","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Defi iota of arXiv:2411.04157, 'Stochastic homogenization of dynamical discrete optimal transport'] For $J\in \mathbb{R}^{\mathcal E}_a$ we define $\iota J\in \mathcal{M}(\mathbb{R}^n;\mathbb{R}^n)$ by 
