{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T08:06:07.095414+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_cd0ed868b8e2a4e9f81aa5864bcc9a8214d5e882e97ef1833c91895cb0bc7540","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 1 of arXiv:2608.28198, 'Performative Privacy: When Differential Privacy Maximizes Utility'] For any given privacy budget $\eps > 0$, setting the perturbation parameter to
