{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T09:36:31.237386+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_cd27d6b0f0aca120066b8592547ec8a9640260471497210787c6b2a1ead3dc34","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 39 of arXiv:2609.00567, 'Hodge--Tate splitting and Akizuki--Nakano vanishing in positive characteristic'] Let \(k\) be a perfect field of characteristic \(p\) and let \(T\) be an algebraic fpqc \(k\)-stack.
