{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T00:22:21.907264+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_cd418a00bb87628282d239da4038e7e1687036e2e7327da7b19745ca354087e0","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lm:proba-topo of arXiv:2411.11429, 'Functional Central Limit Theorem for topological functionals of Gaussian critical points'] Let $ \delta _j = 1 + \frac13 \| i-j \| ,\varepsilon >0$. Then,  
