\mathsf{E}\left[\sup_{t\in[0,T]}|\hat{Y}^i_t|^2\right]\leq CN^{-1}, \ \mathsf{E}\left[\sup_{t\in[0,T]}|\hat{K}_t|^2\right]\leq CN^{-1/2}, \ \mathsf{E}\left[\int_0^T|\hat{Z}^i_t|^2dt\right]\leq CN^{-1/2}.
