{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:06:21.750907+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_cdb867eba45be5db7cf8b92abbb77124bb58912a24908e9c2e3fb248a0239bdf","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 45 of arXiv:2607.21374, 'Local structure at the maximum and sharp persistence asymptotics of rough fractional Brown'] The measures \((\pi_n)\) and the corresponding marked tilted grid laws are
