{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:09:43.673145+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_cdcaa664839a61f04bfa4ab2f18c1937cb9fc8c1e30a7bfa4664e1042663cb5b","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thm:gamma:radonifying of arXiv:2605.28106, 'Gaussian Processes with Sample Paths in Reproducing Kernel Banach Spaces'] Suppose that \( H \) is separable with an orthonormal basis \( (h_k) \).
