{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:27:08.849471+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_cdf00fc46e93da56cf5b3e3a820f11f69b6610d46e85a9bb2ef201d62e998355","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 15 of arXiv:2511.10814, '\Large \bf \boldmath\ \\ Convergence of the extended Kalman filter with small and state-de'] Let $A \in \mathcal{M}_{n,m}(\mathbb{R})$. Then $B = A^+$ if and only if	
