{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T11:09:49.837366+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ce0eeb5d8328a18151438e1e11572a07a8cae04a09d1d0e60d9c2eec452bfcde","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary 36 of arXiv:2609.03070, 'Variants of order semicontinuity in Banach lattices'] The following conditions are equivalent:
