{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:04:39.208906+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ce9a89263995b566817adc4d63519742dc6a0cb9f26fa3bcaa5dff1cc2cbbb16","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 7 of arXiv:2608.13677, 'Asymptotically complete free-energy dissipation: \\ a coarse MLSI holds at any positive te'] \label[lemma]{lemma:computation_flip_density}
