{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T23:06:42.724482+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ceec619eec494f12508d7b39682e8b5fe7a9db012a1d5d05e3bf8bb9fc95fd47","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem4new of arXiv:2411.04238, 'Holomorphic jump-diffusions'] Fix $T >0$,  $\lambda=(\lambda_k)_{k \in \mathbb{N}_0}$, and  $\mu\in \mathcal B$ such that
