{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:35:19.877665+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_cf19cfe60d8140ff2bbd3e5fc6ea3892545a5de76ad7b3a8c8d77e7decd128b3","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem app-hilbert-cocycle of arXiv:2608.27939, 'Entropy and domination for quasi-Hitchin representations'] For every nontrivial $\gamma\in\Gamma$, and the H\"{o}lder cocycle $c_H$ as above,  the period  of $\gamma$ with respect to $c_H$ is precisely the 
