{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T02:39:12.369178+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_cf692e6e83bdb4ac31cc33ef2dad3000edc47f581fd386f1f0d0bd78b26b670a","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:LSI:orthogonal of arXiv:2412.07710, 'An H-theorem for a conditional McKean-Vlasov process related to interacting diffusions on '] Let $\nu \in {\mathcal{M}_{\kappa, d}}$ satisfy \begin{equation}

