{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T05:44:28.008690+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_cf7791f6b55ed6180c89e64d07b97fdf51aa8a8cffd8200185bb4baa80c5bd62","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 11 (FKG inequality for Gaussian fields~\cite{pitt1982}) of arXiv:2607.13308, 'No infinite clusters at criticality for two-dimensional dependent percolation under abstra'] Let $A$ and $B$ be two increasing events depending on finitely many coordinates of $g$. Then
