{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:51:52.062695+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_cfaa37f7a792550cc4cce06911affbf4b38a4ac82b381c50e36987b7e1c933fe","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition D:main-nondegenerate-arc of arXiv:2607.15966, 'Canonical Mandelbrot Cascades on Curves Are Rajchman'] A map \(\gamma:[0,1]\to\mathbb{R}^2\) is a fixed nondegenerate \(C^2\) embedded arc if it is a \(C^2\) embedding and
