{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T21:02:38.607435+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_d005f72dcc5483bfcc64ce569c717dee38941c5b5982f93d12b448842b48556e","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary 6 of arXiv:2607.08242, 'Convergence of random sums in non-commutative probability'] \noindent Under conditions of Theorem \ref{thm31}(i), $*$-convergence of 
