{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T00:45:32.046542+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_d05b9587c9ef3aceea87f114b1aad124f9e54298e128229a3fd3075d1ea33a5e","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Thm dBM of arXiv:2411.14090, '{\bf Exponential Ergodicity in $\W_1$ for SDEs with Distribution Dependent Noise and Parti'] Suppose that {\bf(A2)} holds with
