{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:46:26.254654+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_d083f58f7eecb46c9ace4bb308be0103b56312d4c68c791d9405c589cc488090","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Thm 22 of arXiv:2605.23308, 'Convergence rate estimates for semigroups and heat kernels associated with resistance form'] For $\calX_n=(X_n,d^{X_n},\mu_{X_n}),\;\calX=(X,d^X,\mu_X)\in\frK(\tau)$,
