{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T23:07:56.654689+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_d0c09693e5a73f7c5bb265c82ccf6253f91aa9490f84f0ed04d4f3cf57f81b61","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition of arXiv:2411.04631, 'Existence of Martingale Solutions to Stochastic Constrained Heat Equation'] (\textbf{Aldous Condition}) [dhariwal2017study]
