{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:47:01.670274+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_d0d7c8e68ab6a9bebde5c1ce4b15a6398f0c901e4150665d4a8c7798a9f7af95","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 1 of arXiv:2604.24392, 'Numerical approximation of Markovian BSDEs in infinite horizon and elliptic PDEs'] Assume \eqref{as:generatorf}.
 \begin{enumerate}
  \item If there exists {a parameter $\nu \in (0,2\mu-K_{f,z}^2)$}

