{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:46:26.258730+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_d12a5f75a3fdb7e387c1232331d2401dc237cd9bc90145d406a17a6300ad0142","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Thm 84 of arXiv:2605.23308, 'Convergence rate estimates for semigroups and heat kernels associated with resistance form'] \quad\par
