{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T16:57:16.049142+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_d2052ee7884baff6e113ebdda8d92c54a7ed27e6390a388ca683d58de3f354b9","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition defJt of arXiv:2506.10448, 'Hitting probabilities and the Ekstr\"om--Persson conjecture'] For a positive sequence $\underline{r}=(r_k)_{k=1}^\infty$, define the hitting operator 
