{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:42:16.244291+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_d218128ebb71c45ea40a27f603aef0a32f3e28b2eb8a439708857d34d36b409b","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thm:fullI of arXiv:2607.01463, 'Two Multi--Draw Coupon Collector models with different retention rules'] The full asymptotic expansion of the average of the random variable $T_{N,d}$ in the $d$ coupon collector's problem (d--CCP) is given by  
