{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T10:25:49.857984+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_d24c3182a8058d320acee50d19f320b27c327e4004a1c05e17732b92c03b1276","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 10 of arXiv:2609.02019, '2609.02019'] Let $s>5/2$. Let  $J_n$ be the Friedrichs mollifier defined in \eqref{Define Jn}.
