{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:19:06.750094+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_d2a5a74ad5c9f83e8a00cbdea3232073fad6a414f07f97c04c2717b635a2c292","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thm:q-level-annular-decay-paper of arXiv:2606.08683, 'Exact Fourier dimensions of dyadic Mandelbrot cascades under minimal integrability'] Fix \(q\in(1,2)\) with \(\rho(q)<1\), and let
