{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:20:15.483571+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_d2b96bcbe0c4d05410927d8cef13fba56b3925f0a587afff7d87bc60dc9d7721","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 44 of arXiv:2509.01797, 'Relation between Wick powers and excursion clusters of the 2D GFF'] Let $z,w\in D$ and $b> v\vee (2\lambda)$. Then
