{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T10:34:20.718904+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_d32c112de16a16c19627bf2cd0ef1e2346ca7aa4c6baaec0dd3141b79c641b69","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary 18 (Exact WKBC representation) of arXiv:2609.02196, 'Schr\"odinger Bridges on Lie Group Manifolds for Probabilistic Intrinsic Generation'] For \(\beta^*=\log g_T\), differentiation under the wrapped-kernel integral gives
