	\p\big(|Y_{t,x} - \E[Y_{t,x}]| > s \big) \le 2 \inf_{\alpha \in \left(0,~1/(4\K t)\right)} \exp\left\{ C_{\mathrm{dev}} \alpha^2 t~\|x\| - s \alpha\right\}.
\end{equation} (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T11:26:52.683327+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_d359258b5e2c3776d9826c121ffac647062a02c417f3d8d8cb6ec8c22c8da983","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem 16 of arXiv:2609.03777, '2609.03777'] Let $\mu_1,\mu_2$ be lattice points that satisfy $\mu_1\ordN\mu_2$ and $\mu_1\succ\mu_2$. For $N,j\in\ZZ_{>0}$, we have
