{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T10:42:55.321105+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_d363bc597b93dc0af630cce9fa2e481f558a9af5fd0a7730d76c0af1b6d3469b","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem 33 (Exact evaluation of $\mathcal{U}$) of arXiv:2609.02398, '\textbf{Convex Order Comparisons for Sub-Gamma Random Variables}'] Write $a_0 \coloneqq (2\log 2 - 1)/\left((1 - \log 2)\sqrt{2\log 2}\right)$. The function $\mathcal{U}$ of \eqref{eqn:sgM} is given by
