{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:42:57.182799+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_d386ef6a3a43e45319c4cb45f737c6427df5a3ebabd0b0fd3ddcd3eb134c8882","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thm:uniqueness of arXiv:2609.04140, 'The conformally invariant metric on $\CLE_4$ III:\\ uniqueness'] \begin{enumerate}
