	\begin{align}
		\bbP\bigl(X_{ r_\delta^2} \in\sB(y,\varepsilon) \mid X_0 = x_0 \bigr) \geq c(\varepsilon/ r_\delta )^2.
	\end{align}","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T02:16:53.630729+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_d3be8cc069804fa35a76f24bcd18fab769ba6cb9510bd9307c537e71f89fac71","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:aphi of arXiv:2412.05503, 'Critical scaling profile for trees and connected subgraphs \\ on the complete graph'] Let $x\ge 1$.
