{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T12:48:49.853656+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_d44685342a913c9d99864b8f88e7b92bb63105cc1aba9e75bd69cb7dcbc0e4d1","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:second_moment_Uk of arXiv:2509.16694, 'A central limit theorem for two-dimensional directed polymers with critical spatial correl'] For any $\hat{\beta} \in [0,z_a)$, there exists $C_{\hat \beta}>0$ such that
