R = \sum\limits_{\xi  \in \Lambda } {\gamma _\xi ^2\left( R \right)\xi  \otimes \xi },\ \ \forall \, R \in {\mathbb{B}_{\frac{1}{2}}}\left( {\mathrm{Id}} \right) .
