{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T13:01:22.599874+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_d44e63b20cdd50fb32904ca4bcbe3f8c95b78a53168ef5dbb2e7adbd56144d08","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition of arXiv:2606.10257, 'Downward conditional monotonicity gives survival and extinction for contact processes in r'] Consider the CPMRE having parameters $\beta,\mu,T$ as above, and with $\delta=1$. We have established the following results. 
	\begin{longlist}
		\setlength{\itemindent}{28pt}

		\setlength{\labelsep}{0.4em}
