{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T17:42:08.413137+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_d459d2c2add401bcfa8e5f7f8a5bc86720efaab72536fd6fcd8ff0f7f283844f","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma Palm-Lcal-ii of arXiv:2511.15893, 'On a Class of Dynamical Poisson-Voronoi Tessellations'] For $l=1,2$ and for all non-negative measurable functions $f$ on $(\Omega,{\mathcal F })$,
\begin{align}
