{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T23:11:09.330574+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_d4b37e562c197b0ee8d8cf270b9c4d47800056e1caa990c98c46403556c7a48b","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma explexpr of arXiv:2411.06827, 'The Exponential Lie Series and a Chen--Strichartz Formula for L{\'e}vy Processes'] For $m\geq 1$, we have the explicit expression 
