{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T00:26:20.700778+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_d4c0738d3eec771506671564ec8f3bd66be0726cdc56338a7418539606174125","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem basicwalk of arXiv:2411.12149, 'Airy limit for $\beta$-additions through Dunkl operators'] For $H\in \mathbb{Z}_{\ge 0},\ L\in \mathbb{Z}_{\ge 100}$, sample the walk $W(t)$ from $\mathcal{\tilde{W}}(0,\cdot,L;N)$ and  $\mathcal{\tilde{W}}(\cdot, 0,L;N)$ respectively.
