{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:37:08.952621+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_d56b47de4efeea29bdc202259e6cdf58bb817c1bb0eeb763198eec1eb7b13b8f","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:ambient_mass_finite_restriction of arXiv:2609.01576, '\normalfont Pointwise Majorization for sub-Weibull and Mixed Tail Processes with Applicati'] Let $K\subseteq T$ be finite and contain $t_0$, and let
