{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:25:40.046899+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_d5836a4ea4b0448dbd91606b8569c0e31b6977957f8cd873a1273545a7de7ca4","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary 10 of arXiv:2510.24562, 'Hard wall repulsion for the discrete Gaussian free field in random environment on $\mathbb'] For every $\varepsilon \in (0,1)$, $\rho \in [0,1)$
