for any~$k,k'=1,\dots,\lfloor n/2\rfloor$ such that $\gamma(i)\ge1$ for all~$i=k,\dots,n-k'$. (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T09:52:47.255597+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_d5f9bb71d80d744cc22143a6a8b0d83cab3473afc6e11a0468d602ac3d89dd44","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem 10 of arXiv:2609.01101, '2609.01101'] For $N\ge1$ and arbitrary complex numbers $d_n$,
