{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T17:43:53.631567+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_d5fca11cb13ed2e94a21ccddb4bfe876888f79b6029a264751e8ee7996935b7d","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thm:inter clt of arXiv:2512.17747, 'On exponentially height-penalized random trees'] Let $\mu=\mu_n$ be such that $1/\sqrt{n}\ll\mu\ll n^{1/4}$.
