{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T09:48:30.932955+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_d664fb58b53de49a46fc73af6d8387a37d4bb104778d9a260b974598f9eb1dc4","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 28 of arXiv:2609.01020, '2609.01020'] For any $\alpha \in A$ such that $\alpha \neq \alpha_0, 0\in \overline{Y_\alpha}$ and 
$\dim Y_\alpha <\dim Y$ we have 
