{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:16:18.685085+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_d6fdfc59764c13fe54af4c34f3000a7751f08188616755b7a4bed3d5eee26009","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 7 (Analytic evaluation lemma) of arXiv:2607.26377, '\textbf{Entire Logarithmic Signatures\\ of Bounded-Variation Paths in Finite Dimensions}'] Let $\gamma:[0,T]\to V$ be continuous and of bounded variation, and put $g=S(\gamma)$ and $l=\log g$.
