{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:01:39.423126+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_d705735866cc02c1cad07c7a10627e2c568d26d013efa63981221490593ecb71","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition def:first-second-functionals-fg of arXiv:2607.22156, 'A random matrix approach to lamplighter groups'] Let $x,y\in\mathbb{C}[G]$. The first and second order distributions are defined by
