{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T01:29:08.557290+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_d70afa1eba4b1980d774565da8e3309f613402950a83b2c63157581be8d5e4bc","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition prop-quantum-zipper of arXiv:2411.19810, 'Radial conformal welding in Liouville quantum gravity'] In the above setting, the law of $(\psi, \eta)$ is 
