{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T09:24:34.432243+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_d7bd607a1875c6acdcc554761d06e0f684d8ffd380ed8b20786d2bf0c2b8b246","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 22 (H\"older bump packing) of arXiv:2608.31157, 'Sharp Approximation Rates for Neural Networks with Affine Latent Parameterizations'] Let $d\in\N^+$ and $0<\alpha\le1$, and let
