{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T14:09:34.480659+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_d7c2a33653b0f3147b5eda504eb6a875b68de5c267fb9351e1bf0316de361779","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Defn Capacity in $\mathbb{H}$ of arXiv:2505.14762, 'Multiple radial SLE($\kappa$) and quantum Calogero-Sutherland system'] For any compact subset $K \subset \overline{\mathbb{H}}$ such that $\mathbb{H} \backslash K$ is a simply connected domain. The half-plane capacity of a hull $K$ is the quantity
$$
