{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:52:45.024315+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_d8214a63b1949f65b100c8dcd1d9271f471b812a58ebc3f5ed63287afda7d535","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 1 of arXiv:2606.06739, 'The relationship between the transition functions of the labeled and unlabeled versions of'] For each $n\ge0$ and $\bm p\in\overline{\nabla}_\infty$,
