{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T10:51:11.519561+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_d862eade45a55d99250d98ad0fe23c1257666290c10264651d2a726f3d69711b","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 12 (Signed canonical factorization) of arXiv:2609.02590, 'Directional Optimal Sub-Gamma Scales for Infinitely Divisible Laws'] For every real $t$,
