{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:55:18.065308+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_d8c775f82b82ae4b5f8501489dd5e20c14133c51ff701e7624298e3bdccde05d","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition 31 (Sufficient conditions for $(K)-a.e.$) of arXiv:2606.17452, 'Optional Stopping for Superhedging Supermartingales'] The following two properties are relative to $\mathcal{S}$.
\begin{itemize}[labelwidth=!, leftmargin=*, align=left]
