{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:36:04.991258+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_da073a45c146397492660e5b44f0f62a94a28883e51a9dd39bc08d564be05163","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 2 (Linearized forward equation) of arXiv:2604.00937, 'Infinite Horizon Optimal Control of Forward-Backward Stochastic Volterra Equations with De'] The process $\dot{X}$ satisfies
