{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:43:55.658745+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_da2ae995abd80f8c9dcc06bcaaf126c91dde5c867d7c03d9d1f0ab3eac18c8eb","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Thm no_uniform_abs of arXiv:2604.07183, 'Stopping on the last success with unknown odds: asymptotic minimax optimality of the plug-'] There does not exist a sequence of (possibly randomized) $p$-blind rules~$(\pi_n)$ such that
