{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:37:51.457398+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_da2c1ab56d5251204c7c9c7151eb77fbf5932b937f69616bed71dbcdf3dc364e","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Cor 27 of arXiv:2604.03777, 'Equilibrium fluctuations for a multi-species particle system with long jumps'] Let $\gamma >0$, $0 \leq s \leq t \leq T$, $n \in \mathbb{N}_+$ and $ \widehat{b}_n \in \mathbb{R}$. Then
