{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T11:17:33.984365+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_da3a226bf685d85c859bd32c8064a09c2cbb329bc2a2a72fa2e225c12dd2bab3","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 17 (Exterior PRellich-Pohozaev-type identity) of arXiv:2609.03339, 'Exterior Serrin Rigidity for the Homogeneous \texorpdfstring{$k$}{k}-Hessian Equation\\'] One has
		\begin{equation}
			c^{k+1}\int_{\partial\Omega}hH_{k-1}\,dS
