In addition for any $\eps>0$, any positive integer $n$, any $h_1,\ldots,h_n \in [H]$ and $z_1,\ldots,z_n \in\amsmathbb C$ such that $\min_{i} \textnormal{dist}(z_i,\amsmathbb{A}) \geq \delta$, we have
 \begin{equation}
  \E\Bigg[\bigg|
