{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T18:35:56.960500+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_da6c1bf44810813928953e05008eefdde5623414eec58cba4e29003c45ef3f63","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma E[sl]_asymp of arXiv:2604.05921, 'Simplicity of random hypergraphs'] If $\forall e \in E: \delta_e^{\textnormal{tail}} = \delta_e^{\textnormal{head}} = \delta \in O(1)$ and
\begin{enumerate}
