\item There exist $x',x,y,y' \in \eta_{z_1}^{\theta_2} \cap \eta_{w_1}^R$ such that $(x,y) \in \intptsapproxbubble{U_{x',y'}}{\epsilon}$ as in~(equation eq:intpts_bubble of the paper) and $U_{x',y'} \subseteq B(0,\delta^{1+a_1})$ and $\metapproxacres{\epsilon}{U_{x',y'}}{x}{y}{\Gamma} \geq \median{\epsilon}+\epsilon^{-a_0}\mathbf{a}_{\epsilon}$.
\item The following event has conditional probability at least $p$ given $\eta_{z_1}^{\theta_2}$, $\eta_{w_1}^R$, $X_\delta^{\theta_2}$, $X_\delta^{-\pi/2}$, and the values of $h$ on these sets:
\begin{itemize}
