\item The angle $-\pi/2$ flow line of $h$ from $-i\delta$ to $i\delta$ merges into $\eta_{w_1}^R$ before entering $B(0,\delta/4)$.
\end{itemize}
\end{itemize}
Then $\mathbf{P}[E^p] = O(\delta^{{\alpha_{\mathrm{apr}}}})$ as $\delta \to 0$.","status":"unverified"}

