{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:54:34.578505+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_daddb8693d46f07d32f2fb6d2de4ec652a51ef6b08ec29cb9a1cf3dd33c13a5f","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 8 of arXiv:2606.14876, 'High-Order Talagrand and Eldan--Gross Inequalities via Besov-Type Variance Functionals'] For all $k\in \Nbb$, $f\in \Sob^k(\Rbb^n,\gamma_n)$ with $\left\|f\right\|_{\Leb^\infty}\leq 1$, and $p\in [1,2)$,
