    For $\ell \leq b$ and $I = \{i_0,\ldots,i_{\ell - 1}\} \subseteq [0,b-1]$, let $\mathbf{B}' = (B_{i_0},\ldots,B_{i_{\ell - 1}}) \subseteq \mathbf{B}$ be a subset of blocks.

