{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T10:07:48.568083+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_dc1a0bc13bcd0794070cbc213a0f639f267ac1fb4713b7f9432501c5f7d8c181","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 40 of arXiv:2609.01460, 'On cost-induced Santal\'o-type inequalities \\ in Polish measure spaces'] Let $(X, d, \mu)$ be a Polish probability space. Suppose that either of the following equivalent conditions holds (by Lemma~\ref{l:isop_to_enl} and Proposition~\ref{p:symmetric_isop_enlargement}):
