where $v\left( t, x \right)$ and $u\left( t, x \right)$ are the vector functions on $\left[ {{t_0}, T } \right]  \times   \mathbb{T}^2$. Then, for any $\alpha \in \left[ {0,1} \right)$ and $N \in {\mathbb{Z}^ + } $, we have
