{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T08:44:39.714336+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_dc4605c178f0c485be5615a4cb03c862bd502b3483ba1cfd7602aaa46072f2dc","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 12 (Local $C^0$ estimate) of arXiv:2608.29736, '2608.29736'] There exists a constant \(C>0\), independent of \(t\), such that
