     r^{\frac{3}{2}H}\Indi{\{d=1\}}
   + r^H\log(r)\Indi{\{d=2\}}
   + r^H\Indi{\{d\geq 3\}}
\Big].
\]","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:25:12.198623+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_dc576c958669ea0fdc8afc67fdd29f57a86dc15c13926adfef6230f5383f58e4","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem 49 of arXiv:2510.22783, 'Universality of Cutoff for Riffle Shuffling'] Suppose that there are $y_1$ strings equal to $s_i$ among $\widehat {\mathbf a}_i$.
