{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T18:32:23.740788+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_dccc0d4c34f0e6e72e74e75af2085e6481fa7fde54cf1cd470101542adb31a20","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition def:stopping_times of arXiv:2603.24803, 'Critical Spectral Invariants in Random Walks with Geometric Resetting'] Define the following random times:

