{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:58:09.041405+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_dcd10962968ee9c33d6d6fc5442b3319055363f2d31b4debd1acf225809ef9af","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem 10 (All good) of arXiv:2606.27035, 'R\'emy's diffusion on Brownian trees'] The following events occur with a probability tending to $1$ as $n \to \infty$:
