{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:12:19.463672+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_dcd2d7ef27706dd55b62e243d26a80dda3829472a201d3b81c714ba49312b6d1","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 8 (Fundamental estimate with localization parameter) of arXiv:2608.17540, 'Pathwise stability for one-dimensional SDEs driven by Brownian motion and a symmetric stab'] Assume Assumptions~\ref{ass:baseline}--\ref{ass:solutions}. Then there exists a constant
\[
