  in the space $\mathfrak{M}_{c}(\markedfinMeasFunct{\mathbb{R}_{\geq 0}})$.","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T13:56:17.353809+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ddcb807ec44a6fbfc4a6f8e113366bc022a4c5168b95bb687d799f281493e3d6","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma norm-concentration of arXiv:2605.14149, 'The mean-field limit of online stochastic vector balancing'] Let $U_1,\dots,U_n$ be i.i.d.\ random variables with ${\mathbb E}\,U_i=0$ and ${\mathbb E}\,U_i^2\leq 1$. Define $\bm{U}=(U_1,\dots,U_n)$. Then,
	\begin{align}
		{\mathbb E}\big[\big(|\bm{U}|_2-\sqrt{n}\big)_+^2\big]
		&\leq 2\mathrm{Var}(U_1^2) \leq 2\,{\mathbb E}\,U_1^4.
	\end{align} (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:02:34.826918+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ddcdd3ac60a00add6e026baa53e27e9899e543ee89a1e889c684c487fe8f4974","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 41 (Short-time full covariance negative moments) of arXiv:2607.19752, 'Weak Equilibrium Measures and Capacity--Hitting Identities\\ for the Hypoelliptic Third-Or'] For every $q\ge1$, after decreasing $t_0$ if necessary,
