{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T12:19:47.211701+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_de5b43aa2878e6b948bedaf828a7495d152e331f657a1d168f06769ff9ae7ade","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma partiallambda of arXiv:2512.06640, 'Existence and sharpness of the phase transition for the frog model on transitive graphs'] For any $\lambda, t > 0$ and any finite set $\Lambda \subset V$, we have
