{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:23:58.614380+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_de5e288bd7b51df9aead5b854906a289e58dbbef5c4a6934c88fae5f067dc127","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition 118 (Notation for powers of $\weight$) of arXiv:2609.03101, 'The emergence of the Cauchy horizon from the crease for $3D$ compressible Euler flow'] For $N \le \Ntop$, we set:
