{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:01:25.574760+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_de6187995f9a88a4019de49688245018e1aa50f7cdb2b876e9581782b39a97cc","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma Lemma-stoch-cv of arXiv:2605.15742, 'Turbulent stretching of FENE dumbbell polymer model via special stochastic scaling and sin'] The   following  convergence holds:  
