{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:31:20.599474+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_deaa0c5f864a263125ed8a064e362d8cb2877a7e457a3f7dd78756bc063d6a66","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 24 (Trace norm and Bures–Wasserstein distance) of arXiv:2608.25706, 'Fast rates in Bayesian online learning with approximate posteriors'] \label[lemma]{lem:gp-bures}
For positive trace-class operators $A$ and $B$ 
