{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:42:47.772767+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_deb20ae28fbecd7cd580380e5074278b1b99f11b33854aa8fdebd197e612e7df","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 20 (Boundary term) of arXiv:2604.12797, 'A free boundary problem for the mean-field limit of diffusing particles with nonlinear bou'] We have
