{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T23:48:35.819784+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_debad811d5fa4d240a449ce56a8e358f0a20b81b305e426e67bec2f9432846ac","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thm: Heat Kernel Bound of arXiv:2411.09614, 'Moment estimates for the stochastic heat equation on Cartan-Hadamard manifolds'] Let $M$ be a Hadamard manifold.

