{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T00:26:20.492031+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_debadf7d838948d31e113257037bc8b5c0bfa1595abd08548b7b7e11cc6d2535","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem lemma:M-contraction-map of arXiv:2411.11676, 'Surface sums for lattice Yang--Mills in the large-$N$ limit'] Let $K_* : \mathcal{P}_{\mathbb{Z}^d} \rightarrow \mathbb{N}$ be a plaquette assignment and $M_* \geq 1$ an integer.
