{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:12:19.528235+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_df339cec12beb066d7f13f1cb5798378455d14f5c6aaff876ef17b08bbf18957","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 9 of arXiv:2608.18557, 'Randomly Permuted Orthogonal Products and Fast Dimension Reduction'] Let \(X\) be a random variable and let \(\sigma,M>0\). Suppose that
	\[
