{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T00:52:17.581049+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_dfe921ab4ea87ddafa7b5c26d401f3d694eef11f1b0a3678924cce68de6ca461","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma ConR of arXiv:2411.15485, '\bf\Large Stochastic Volterra Equations for Local Times of Spectrally Positive L\'evy Proc'] For each $\beta\geq 0$ and $y\geq 0$, we have  as $n\to\infty$, 
