{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:58:40.817337+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e0968d5cd7900b378ca7a0cf8fe07ae44a80b9409d1e08fa6bda350c26bcefe6","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem LSL^2 of arXiv:2605.10309, 'Exponential Decay of $L^2$-Solutions to Stochastic Nonlinear Schr\"odinger Equations Drive'] Assume (H1) and (H2), and let $1<\alpha <1+\frac{4}{d}$.
