{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:41:33.821132+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e0dd10db18bd4262f2e58a2046b31c4b8f523e5838f2fd9bd1611f5879449140","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 1 (Harnack inequality) of arXiv:2604.10142, 'H\MakeLowercase{arnack inequality for} $p$\MakeLowercase{-harmonic functions: \\ improved '] Let $u$ be a positive $p$-harmonic function on $B_R(0)$ where $R>1$. Then $u$ satisfies the Harnack inequality:
