{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T05:30:36.778029+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e0ec7e692bcb38b60edf3f383dc19294621ed6784289fb7d81079a6e02387951","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 10 of arXiv:2607.10486, 'Weak martingale solutions to stochastic Navier-Stokes-Cahn-Hilliard system with transport '] Assume that $\bu \in \StokesV$ and $\phi,\,\psi \in \newone{V}$. Then, the following equalities hold:  
   \begin{equation}
