{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T11:26:52.661011+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e10ea10f678b393be95be427f3090683e1c9f70a3ce189808355c3d03d23dcdc","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition 3 (homogeneous bundle and induced representation) of arXiv:2609.03736, '2609.03736'] The homogeneous bundle associated with $E$ is
