The Hilbert space of sections is the induced representation
\begin{equation}
 \mathcal I_E=L^2(X,\cE_E)=\Ind_{\mathsf H}^{\mathsf G}E.

\end{equation}
Equivalently, $\mathcal I_E$ consists of functions $f:\mathsf G\to E$
satisfying $f(gh)=h^{-1}f(g)$, with inner product
\begin{equation}
