{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T13:57:59.843616+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e1740e3f72dadb3711e7b8eeff7361a47ea6710e2088ed1fc1815fbbfb1c771b","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma nb_paths of arXiv:2606.09488, 'The temporal stochastic block model'] For all $u,v \in V$ and for all $\ell \in {\mathbb N}$,
