{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:45:07.268918+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e191ae8a6242b77f0cae9f7651e56dd0604afdb19342ae7d8e7d165aa7c7ba09","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lm 19 of arXiv:2604.20435, 'Stochastic Extinction with Relaxed Boundedness Conditions'] Let $p^*\in (0,\frac{\gamma_0}4)$ be fixed.
