{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T02:04:40.983647+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e21c85d6028901983d6c776118be021a6d85fffc610d31df4236c6372ef2117d","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary coro_2 of arXiv:2412.03774, '{ Refining Concentration for \\Gaussian Quadratic Chaos with\\ Applications in Sonar and C'] For a symmetric matrix $A$, 
