{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:59:25.040906+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e25053a5d30a1e38b8bf8c01e6fb1040dc3131d98743b770fa7f5803a8e9e6bb","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 11 of arXiv:2606.31596, 'The Invariant Measure of Multiscale Markov Chains via Fast Arborescence Factorization'] The limiting measure \eqref{laformula} in Theorem \ref{ilteo} is the unique solution $\pi=\bar\pi^{(0)}$ of the recursion \eqref{laformulaiti}. It can be computed as:
