{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T10:34:20.715135+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e26c09f4505d98a14ed9a43d7bbe38de63ec9abd61d3d0d59267283e33fb776b","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 16 (Observed endpoint Schr\"odinger system) of arXiv:2609.02196, 'Schr\"odinger Bridges on Lie Group Manifolds for Probabilistic Intrinsic Generation'] Under Assumption~\ref{ass:endpoint-kernel}, the static endpoint problem
\begin{equation*}
