{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:22:20.951879+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e27138deb2f224b0720fb6e352e4234e3e6663b1144ebde15e7c4939461094f5","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 6 of arXiv:2604.05234, 'Quantitative propagation of chaos and universality for asymmetric Langevin spin glass dyna'] There exists a constant $C_S \in (0, \infty)$ depending on $\sigma^2$ only such that if
