{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:21:52.418838+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e27231e10467bee53726508154351890d24ddf70c07bce42e82d05c6d04af81b","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 116 of arXiv:2601.16377, '2601.16377'] In the setting of Proposition~\ref{Proposition_ZW_partition}, the leading term of the partition function satisfies
