{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T18:51:26.725672+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e2d8f125acafc985fdc35c3ce2302a3d5e142ade1154b00c6179f8de5e2bb4ff","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thm:main of arXiv:2606.08325, 'Digit Mixing under Polynomial Maps'] Let \(P\in\mathbb R[x]\) have degree \(d\ge2\).
