{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:47:22.258396+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e31cba1227fb4cada764f45be2da62a139f69fe4a91e5bdc262f6a8102283711","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem 125 (\cite{LTDMLS}) of arXiv:2605.26664, 'Mixing times for Glauber dynamics of lozenge tilings of the hexagon'] Set $c=3-a-b$ and define the sets 
		\begin{flalign*}
