{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T22:34:45.593655+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e451f79aaaa84563fb2ca6fe4a95172b1ebd59a0ffb3ac237d3a351755afae82","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:flags of arXiv:2609.01776, 'On the Cuspidal Cohomology of Iwahori Congruence Subgroups of $\mathrm{SL}(3, \mathbb{Z})$'] Let $\mathbb{F}_p = \mathbb{Z}/p\mathbb{Z}$.  Further, let $\overline{B}$ denote the Borel subgroup of upper triangular matrices in $\overline{G} = \mathrm{SL}(n, \mathbb{F}_p)$.  Let $V = \{v_1, \ldots, v_m\}$ and $W = \{w_1, \ldots, w_m\}$ be two saturated lists in $\mathbb{Z}^n$.  Let $V_i$ and $W_i$ denote the subspaces of $\mathbb{Q}^n$ generated by $\{v_1, \ldots, v_i\}$ and  $\{w_1, \ldots, w_i \}$ respectively. 

