In particular, the $(\{0,1\} \times \PolishX^\infty)^{\V_1}$-valued random variables $(1_{\{v \in \tree\}},X_v)_{v \in \V_1}$ and $(1_{\{v \in \bar{\tree}\}},\Xbar_v)_{v \in \V_1}$ have the same law. (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

