{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:24:30.016948+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e4dd09d3c389e4f64f14fc18822862f01ac4f770c881fcb41bbbfc53a320b9c5","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 16 of arXiv:2605.05864, 'Classification and Metrization of Classes of Smooth measures'] Assume that $\mu\in{\cal S}$ and its $\alpha$-potential
