{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T11:07:35.021302+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e4e7890a1d5e7772d07568607ff899921f7b57ba173019ae607a37ce4f943a3e","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 46 of arXiv:2609.02878, '2609.02878'] Fix a limiting point \(\xi=(\mu_t)_{t<1}\) based at
