{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T13:56:17.366165+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e4ec03cf9c2e3cb31569cefc77e1e68ee8fda7f722952dca6449b8446c5b4649","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:bounded first moments of arXiv:2606.02472, 'Correlated uniform attachment trees'] Let $T_n \sim \mathrm{UA}(n)$, let $u \in \{0,\ldots,n\}$ and let $r \in \left[1,n\right]$. Then
