{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T23:03:39.776049+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e50184e1fff0de4fa8b8ddd9822f96a25366a03434ac2fd8b06284684d4b85f8","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Cor sufficient-inequalities of arXiv:2411.03065, 'Growing conditioned BGW trees with\\ log-concave offspring distributions'] Let $({\mathbf{a}},{\mathbf{b}})$ be a non-degenerate weight pair and assume that $r=r({\mathbf{a}})$ is finite.
