{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:54:34.577437+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e50562df51fb3424d02bd14057cd023a13fde19d0cfaa6a01ee6c47c23ca8b9e","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 16 of arXiv:2606.14812, 'Joint convergence in Wiener chaos via transport hierarchy and Malliavin covariances'] Let $p\geq 2$ and let $(X_N=I_p(f_N),N\geq 1)$ satisfy 
