{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T11:57:07.197718+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e573d61abcaa358a45eb463ae693e588a1cbf57a8c53c5a006290ea66c36fb6a","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:rare-events-changing-Z of arXiv:2509.04333, 'The limiting law of the Discrete Gaussian level lines'] Let $V_1, V_2, U_1, U_2$ be any domains such that $V_1 \subset V_2$ and $U_1 \subset U_2$. Suppose we have the bounds on the partition functions
