{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:22:08.538690+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e695ddeb57695dac09338d6034fe3280cf26449bdaa0a751f8e59e32904e508f","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary cor:GLPP-scalar of arXiv:2608.02772, 'Non-Abelian Hirota-Miwa Equations for the KPZ Universality Class'] The one-point Fredholm determinant
