{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:22:08.539624+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e69dd250b137b44f720921c9252f1f2f750c0c6ea5c524a2a4ddcc889a66832a","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:CT-TASEP-WF of arXiv:2608.02772, 'Non-Abelian Hirota-Miwa Equations for the KPZ Universality Class'] The product-graph wave functions satisfy the dual
