{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:58:09.038019+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e6e132caf274f8d755b5398164435d9d56a806c8e466be2d6aa69a03888c639a","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 5 (\cite{Nishimori_Tomisaki_Tsuchida_Uemura_2025} Proposition3.10) of arXiv:2606.26496, 'Homeomorphism of the Revuz correspondence under Dynkin class assumptions'] \begin{itemize}
