		^{(\textnormal{reg})} F(\Delta s,t,x^2,x^3) & \eqdef \, ^{(\textnormal{reg})}\Lambda_{\Delta s} \circ  \embeddingdatahypfortimefunctionarg{0}(t, x^2,x^3),  
