as the flowout of $\datahypfortimefunctiontwoarg{0}{[\timefunction_0,0]}$ by $^{(\textnormal{reg})}\newuL$. Then $^{(\textnormal{reg})} F$ is a $C^{1,1}(^{(\textnormal{reg})}\mathscr{F})$-diffeomorphism with inverse  $^{(\textnormal{reg})} F^{-1} \in C^{1,1}_{\textnormal{geo}}(^{(\textnormal{reg})}\mathscr{D})$ satisfying:
