That is, the flowouts to the left and right of $\datahypfortimefunctiontwoarg{0}{[\timefunction_0,0]}$ always terminate on $ \hypthreearg{0}{[- \rightu,\leftu]}{0}$ and $ \hypthreearg{\timefunction_0}{[- \rightu,\leftu]}{0}$, respectively.

