{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:07:15.754750+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e6e59c6fdda898892b9b9126c98b37a234785edc006515a1cd1e4a22feb26c14","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition prop:abstract-common-domain of arXiv:2608.02459, 'Response Calculus for Spectral Simplicity\\ and Joint Eigenvalue Densities'] The operator $\widehat A_{\tau,f}$ is associated in $L^2(\mu)$ with
