{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T16:50:27.054265+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e776026d6d8a2f45bcae7148f9ee22b3b709477bbf05ecac46a1e3305b646ef8","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:2nd of arXiv:2505.14012, 'Ergodicity for stochastic neural field equations'] Suppose that
