{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:28:49.058797+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e85318f83589c62d1bf95bf5a708a9e4a9d889421f9541205cf7f43a9c0ad497","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thm:zero-terminal-source-problem of arXiv:2608.16119, 'Fully nonlinear parabolic equations under a fixed reference diffusion: weighted \texorpdfs'] Let $\alpha\geq0$ and let $w$ be a regular weight of order $\alpha$.
