{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:22:46.469016+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e86329edea405d3f59ca3f3d842f2ea0bce591f0118cf3c9e8eeb1842b433411","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition 72 (The first fundamental forms of $\doublenulltoritwoarg{\ubar}{u}$) of arXiv:2609.03101, 'The emergence of the Cauchy horizon from the crease for $3D$ compressible Euler flow'] \hfill
