{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:10:05.696818+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e8ae800d7643e5637a7eff934e625a5b229ff958a4ff5f26f2d8129d7844ac8b","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary 22 (Wendel--Stirling mixtures) of arXiv:2608.16752, 'Absorption Probabilities for Random Convex Hulls: Distribution-Freeness via the Wall-Cross'] For $n\geq 1$ and $d\geq 0$,
