{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:17:04.325004+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e8ca0d85ecba5263c8cb79bc054d32a69d52896d47239aafd9490c68d1845138","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma of arXiv:2606.01866, 'Phase Transition of a Semiflexible Membrane in Two Dimensions'] \label[lemma]{lemma:fracSobolev}
