    \end{cases}
    \]
    where $\mathcal{I}(\cdot)$ and $\rho_{1, q, \gamma}$ are defined in \eqref{eq:rate-function} and \eqref{eq:self-tilted-var}, respectively. (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

