{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:44:17.167850+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ea48a7454c3e54706543c28aa7d8ea5583d66df3a619f1e69b05c6855c697c05","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 11 of arXiv:2604.17973, 'Schauder estimates and classical solutions of the Dirichlet problem for stochastic parabol'] Let $u$ be a quasi-classical solution of \eqref{eq:model-half-space}--\eqref{eq:model-half-space-bc} with $g\equiv0$. Assume that
