{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:59:45.008496+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ea8ff50848af27288ebf592feec200c671b8be6c404f89e50663da2df1689762","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma re4D of arXiv:2605.12777, 'Mesoscopic Rates of Convergence for Complex Wishart Matrices at the Leftmost Spectrum Edge'] Under the same assumption as in Lemma (keyI of the paper), let $\tilde{x}_N(s)=\tilde{\mu}_{n,N}-\tilde{\sigma}_{n,N}s$ with
