{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:50:48.854845+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_eae78f91615dad9bfd90f05fbf4119902eb585fa3942231ed287a9cc2e051fe9","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem RPD_L_n of arXiv:2607.12061, 'Models for species evolution with random deaths'] Let $f^\dagger_c = \tfrac{qr}{p}$ and suppose $p>q$.
\begin{itemize}
