            Z_d
            \end{array}\right), $$
      where $Z_3 \sim \Pois(\lambda_1), \ldots, Z_d \sim \Pois(\lambda_d)$ are independent.  \hfill $\Box$ (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:56:49.283008+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_eb1992cfcaa8c93a2a02ef7c26aaf296207e4370fca51d84561bfee86e351617","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 6 of arXiv:2606.22656, 'Fluctuations of Point Vortex Ensembles\\ at Small Negative Inverse Temperature'] For every finite simple graph $\Gamma$ with $n$ vertices and every $\beta_*<8\pi$,
