{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:49:17.500150+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_eb2889b18c0adc03f46da055747772af8dc1de26502c5ebc43a8cf85cdf6c4ad","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 4 of arXiv:2605.30030, 'Critical exponents for planar random-cluster model with cluster-weight~$q=4$'] For the four-state Potts model on~$\mathbb Z^2$:
