{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:42:16.247584+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_eb4a3d3e3b312e158de7746b51d5bfc52d0d43588a903ee5e9d8fadb83d52010","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thm:PP conv general of arXiv:2607.01946, 'Second-order fluctuations for a phase transition in random partitions'] For $(p_n)_{n\in{\mathbb N}}$ under the assumption (equation eq:p_n general of the paper), we have
\begin{equation}
