{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-09T07:38:10+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ebe1295e9102dd02623bcaa4a56cb21205f3f977868a5032865d9441b9b785d0","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 2.4 (Kac, Pleijel) of arXiv:2507.06186, '2507.06186'] If $\partial D$ is sufficiently regular (e.g., smooth), then
