(iii) For all $t>0$ and $A\subset\mathbb{D}[0,t]$,
\begin{align*}
        \E (N^{K,A}_{t})  & =\int_\R K^{\beta^K_0(x)}\E_{\mu^K_{x,T}}\Big[\exp\Big(\log K\int_0^{t} R(Y_s^K) ds \Big)\mathbbm{1}_{(Y^K_{s})_{s\in[0,t]}\in A}\Big]dx.
