where $\Delta B^k_{H,\lambda}=B_{H,\lambda}(t_{k+1})-B_{H,\lambda}(t_k)$
and $\Delta\mathbb{B}^k_{H,\lambda}=\mathbb{B}_{H,\lambda}(t_k,t_{k+1})$.
Then
