{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:56:49.289625+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ec567a2536d12fbfd2e392a810ec52bccc52264b4a957e00a4fcc7a48d5165bd","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 14 of arXiv:2606.23099, 'Path-dependent Affine Processes'] In the setting of Lemma~\ref{lm:non-negativ-diffusion-dim-1},
