{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T00:55:42.215116+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ec7192f7eceaa05b4f4b2df5efa6faff60b4ea9655d974c00a0c4fd6439f82dc","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:mgf of arXiv:2411.16366, 'Connections between sequential Bayesian inference and evolutionary dynamics'] \textbf{Moment generating function}.  Consider 
