{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T13:56:17.358531+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ecaf6d41e9ae38d137257238eeafb6bf72c4195aeda0b6479b9fa02f1f871e14","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem.vinf.dpp of arXiv:2605.14149, 'The mean-field limit of online stochastic vector balancing'] For each $t_0 \in [0,1)$, $h \in (0,1 - t_0]$, we have
