 \limsup_{k \to \infty} \limsup_{n \to \infty} \left[\sup_{i \in \mathcal C_{k,n}} b_{k,n}^{(i)}(u) {\rm e}^{2(k+ik^\gamma)^{\frac{1}{2}-\eta}}\right] \leq 1,	
