	\lim_{k \to \infty} \limsup_{n \to \infty} \mathbb{P}\left( \exists i \in \mathcal C_{k,n} : |\mathbb{Z}^{i}_{n}(u)| > {\rm e}^{-(k+ik^\gamma)^{\frac{1}{2}-\eta}}\right) = 0.
