{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:37:51.457208+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ed58dfa1e220a776b52046dc025851f2353cb67e78192335e67ffe5f6e6d05f2","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem 25 of arXiv:2604.03777, 'Equilibrium fluctuations for a multi-species particle system with long jumps'] Let $\gamma \geq 1$, $0 \leq s \leq t$ and $n \in \mathbb{N}_+$. Then the expectation in \eqref{varxznear2order} is bounded from above by
