  \sup_{|k| \leq z_{n}}\mathbb{E}\bigl[H(X_1,\ldots,X_{m_n}) \mid S_n = k\bigr] \leq C\, \mathbb{E}\bigl[H(X_1,\ldots,X_{m_n})\bigr].
