{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T01:16:46.780305+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ed8ee78aabd5ba2e9d1a09590315a10e832570eaf74aefb37a3ebb812c7239ea","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theo thm:ConvergenceSemiGroup of arXiv:2411.19543, 'Feller property and convergence for semigroups of time-changed processes'] \begin{enumerate}
