{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:54:34.578664+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_eecd59698c4e3fa3bcc3af6fbc75991056b22e0f6a8478c6c5daff10727c330f","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 10 of arXiv:2606.14876, 'High-Order Talagrand and Eldan--Gross Inequalities via Besov-Type Variance Functionals'] For all $k\in \Nbb$, $f\in \Sob^k(\Rbb^n,\gamma_n)$ and $q\in [1,2)$,
\begin{equation}
    \left\|\left|\grad^k f\right|\right\|_{\Leb^2}^{2} \geq \Wop^{\geq k}(f) \left[1+ \frac{q}{2k(2-q)}\ln^+\left(\frac{\Wop^{\geq k}(f)}{\sum_{\kappa:|\kappa|=k} \left\|\Dop^\kappa f\right\|_{\Leb^q}^2} \right)\right]^k,
\end{equation}
and further for $\left\|f\right\|_{\Leb^\infty}\leq 1$ and $q\leq p<2$,
\begin{equation}
    \left\|\left|\grad^k f\right|\right\|_{\Leb^p}^{p} \geq C^{\text{\rm\ref{thm:high-order-Eldan-Gross-Gaussian}}}(p,q)^k\Wop^{\geq k}(f) \left[1 +  \frac{q}{2k(2-q)}\ln^+\left(\frac{1}{\sum_{\kappa:|\kappa|=k} \left\|\Dop^\kappa f\right\|_{\Leb^q}^2} \right)\right]^\frac{kp}{2},
\end{equation}
with $C^{\text{\rm\ref{thm:high-order-Eldan-Gross-Gaussian}}}(p,q) = C^{\text{\rm\ref{thm:high-order-Eldan-Gross-Boolean}}}(p,q) \gtrsim \left(2-p\right)\left(2-q\right)$. (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

