{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:57:44.958597+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_eeeb3ee1df8a39086b880b4488061fb0b42200943771e3c7c9e33db8d834b718","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 13 (Two-parameter Banach-valued chaining) of arXiv:2606.26065, 'Localized Centered Second-Chaos Operators'] Let $X(u)$, $u\in\Delta_T$, take values in a separable Banach space $B$.  Suppose that for some $p_0\ge2$, $0<\theta\le1$, and constants $R_0,R_1$,
