{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T10:47:32.876284+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ef12039fc88cf614dfc5b93dc53076551944f47abd846265738f8d2dde9313d6","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 22 (Global length--dimension formula) of arXiv:2609.02449, 'Finite Directional Coefficient Modules over Euler Fibers of $A$-Hypergeometric Systems'] The all-lattice directed formal logarithmic solution space is finite-dimensional, and
