\frac{C^{-1}}{\sqrt{1+ND_H}}e^{N(F(H)-\beta H k)}\leq P_{N}(h(S) = k) \leq \frac{C}{\sqrt{1+ND_H}} e^{N(F(H)-\beta H k)}
