{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T01:16:46.726250+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ef7962cc004927d08500fb98e1699ee7806ca173089a1b0c010e8a82179248fe","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary cor:main of arXiv:2411.19163, '\bfseries Random polytopes in convex bodies:\\ Bridging the gap between extremal container'] Under the assumptions of Theorem (thm:main of the paper) the following holds:
