{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:20:15.485764+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_effa05025d9d5e11968942db2ee97745702d138e3679300939e30b2a62c3ba91","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 73 of arXiv:2509.01797, 'Relation between Wick powers and excursion clusters of the 2D GFF'] For $n\geq 1$ and $z\in\C$,
\begin{eqnarray*}
:\Phi^{n}_{\varepsilon}:(z)&=&
