{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:19:06.750934+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f03315fa3cbb942e8f6cf028f22e8f64167d3903ad7c0da04d9460bfa5b82598","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:alive-tree-supercritical-support-witness of arXiv:2606.08683, 'Exact Fourier dimensions of dyadic Mandelbrot cascades under minimal integrability'] Assume the minimal Kahane--Peyri\`ere regime. Then \(\mathbb{P}(W>0)>1/2\). Hence
\begin{equation*}
