{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:33:01.754944+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f1dabe1a7c39a3f0f6a3ae1d3e8b3fc0a98fd2d1356eb0a2b2b8275e41b350c6","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 4 of arXiv:2605.14254, '2605.14254'] The process $\xi^{\lambda,z}$ is a semi-martingale and it has the following dynamic:
