    \item  For all sufficiently large $n$ we have $\sup_{z\in [-n^{1/4}\kappa,0]}|\psi'''(z)|=\alpha\kappa^3n^{3/4}$.
\end{enumerate} (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:55:18.049769+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f20b44b467f3fd9ad35a1ef731a01c052dd87899b35500448f840129a7be362b","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary 13 of arXiv:2606.16083, 'Eyring--Kramers asymptotics for infinite-dimensional stochastic gradient systems'] Let $\ell>0$. Then
\[
