{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T10:20:30.608524+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f237e5da33030c135d404793e4fa8e90af4947def74b9778baeb4d26f7958388","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 19 (Relative Boolean matchings) of arXiv:2609.01882, '\textbf{Coxeter Descents and Parabolic Homotopy Colimits}\\[2mm] \large A Hochster-type de'] After choosing a total ordering of $S$, the relative complex $C_*(K_S,L_D;\Z)$ admits a unit acyclic matching with
