        Moreover, for every deterministic matrix $B\in\C^{L\times L}$ with $\|B\| = O(1)$, we have
        \begin{align}
                \avg{B\Om(G(z),z)}_L = O_\prec \left((1+\phi)^6\frac{\vphi+\eta}{N\eta}\right). 
        \end{align} (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

