{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T12:19:47.212987+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f3498fa694319917372259a7ac5068c62670c5f54252d1931281342a1da3e2b9","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma random_walk_expected_hitting_size_main_text of arXiv:2512.06640, 'Existence and sharpness of the phase transition for the frog model on transitive graphs'] Let $G$ be a quasi-transitive graph of superlinear polynomial growth.
