{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:23:27.788985+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f3a79a528c51861b2d0ad36e648a155607c57801a1cbb7ea34e8658fef5742eb","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem of arXiv:2606.09228, 'On topological indices of random caterpillar graphs'] We have
    \begin{align*}
