{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:20:15.486858+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f3b941fce8f708ce67d4fd065cdfd48620707089074a03df62ea1393a95555c5","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Thm 85 of arXiv:2509.01797, 'Relation between Wick powers and excursion clusters of the 2D GFF'] For the generation $m=0$ and $n\geq 1$ odd,
