{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:55:37.878813+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f3fd628689c3fb709f5e74b987478824595e035b26729e66c6a5159ffef523d2","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prop CDFboundsconverge of arXiv:2605.07920, 'Primitive Sequences for Probability Measures on Compact Intervals'] Under the setup of (cor:cdfbounding of the paper), we have 
