{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:31:20.577309+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f49fd936f24ad968ea443b1ed5b604308d1fa64daca0f4fbdb19512c08edc69d","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 4 of arXiv:2608.25094, 'Noising-Denoising by Large Temperature Schr\"{o}dinger Bridges'] In addition to Assumption \ref{assumption}, suppose that 
