{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:33:43.750125+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f521f3bce598806cd3a2809f1f706f07c0ac45e32bd4dbe64e7c874087fcaa9f","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary of arXiv:2608.30493, '\bf McKean-Vlasov Differential Equations:\\ {An introduction and a focus on some kinetic m'] Assume that 
