{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T15:12:20.542781+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f52ebb3a6e8df2046a801b4650735c2f14fc3fa21858a275946ea591398776f3","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:at_1 of arXiv:2603.27906, 'Marked GUE-corners process in doubly periodic dimer models'] The following identities hold:
