{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:29:14.931269+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f5342ed4b24dd4ad51a9c3153ddcb17e017433914473e2265c39039819757e0d","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary Cor.TildeGNorm of arXiv:2606.13442, 'Scaling limit of additive functionals for reversible non-gradient exclusion process: criti'] We have the following estimates for $\overline{G}_\lambda$:
