$A_{s,t}:=\int_{s}^{t}f(r, x_s)d B_{r}^H$ where the integral is defined as a conditional Wiener integral. Then \(A\in H_\eta^p\cap \bar H_{\bar \eta}^p\) and 
\begin{equation}
\|\int_{s}^{t}f(r, x_r)d B_{r}^H\|_{p} \lesssim |f|_{-\kappa,p}(|t-s|^{H-\kappa}+\|x\|_{\alpha}(t-s)^{(\bar \eta -\alpha)})
\end{equation}
and 
\begin{equation}
