        \end{itemize} (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T00:26:20.491134+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f791142c4dfd1bd8d7800c3e1624e8816ecf757bd604cc4326af8808f3d51140","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Cor almostdone of arXiv:2411.11676, 'Surface sums for lattice Yang--Mills in the large-$N$ limit'] Let $\Lambda_N$ be an increasing sequence converging to $\mathbb{Z}^d$.
