{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:23:05.299400+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f7f4d987707a425e2f2d151917dba5fd84b423469a2ef7802b11c9e7ba9e5658","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 9 (Automatic prior-score energy lower bound) of arXiv:2608.21709, 'Posterior Information Dynamics of Diffusion Models for Linear Inverse Problems'] Assume $\Tr\Cov(X_0)<\infty$ and let $\mu_t=\E X_t$.  For every $t>0$,
