{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:37:08.952000+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f7f820b9412ce928e09e19442add8b09994762a2e84076e22e5f756470e0cd58","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary thm:diffusion_pointwise_majorization of arXiv:2609.01576, '\normalfont Pointwise Majorization for sub-Weibull and Mixed Tail Processes with Applicati'] Suppose that Assumptions (ass:diffusion_coefficients of the paper) and
