{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:57:31.002324+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f8001b4a3a55ae16fad9d52b1ecc96ab10406145ebdaf88a994fdfd2687a3f16","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 59 (All-degree intrinsic primitive--Fock unitary) of arXiv:2608.12492, 'Weak Limits of Wiener Chaos: Primitive--Fock Classification and Hilbert--Stein Extraction'] The direct sum
