{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:53:00.814121+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f84795773924f65516e9d308f59509a298496f0e889490cc26c480528c254439","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition def:cuts_rays_paths of arXiv:2607.16911, 'Multipartite random graphs with given degrees: local limit, revisiting the giant, distance'] For any type path or ray $\pi=(s_0\rightarrow s_0s_1 \rightarrow s_0s_1s_2 \rightarrow \dots)$ with length $|\pi|$, and for any $1\leq i \leq |\pi|-1$, we define
