{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T23:57:20.675636+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f86cb577bdae3379196aeefe3cd86f99fcb97f337b4c859a674a04510dbb9824","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lemma1 of arXiv:2411.10235, '\textbf{Smooth transport map via diffusion process}'] For all $k\in \{2,...,\lfloor \beta \rfloor +1\}$, $t\in [0,1)$ and $x\in \mathbb{R}^d$, we have
