{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T17:42:08.459562+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f86d0e8fb4e390147f93c694affba15f9877827d883e800538b3aefc22811c45","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition notation:BCset1 of arXiv:2511.15893, 'On a Class of Dynamical Poisson-Voronoi Tessellations'] For each $(R,\alpha)$ atom of  $\tilde{\Phi}$, let 

