{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T09:24:34.422456+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f8c51f3a0d80fde9c077e7d601160dfb22dffb91c8f753ff633879482aebed61","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 3 (Lower bound for H\"older functions) of arXiv:2608.31157, 'Sharp Approximation Rates for Neural Networks with Affine Latent Parameterizations'] Let $d\in\N^+$ and $0<\alpha\le1$.  There exists a constant
