{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:17:17.064311+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f9146c3fbdd71782d4e48151e4ed60a0e44d620e292795ec0345c777e5e7ab28","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 20 of arXiv:2608.19744, 'Conditioned Brownian motion and local equivalence of path ensembles'] The process
