{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T08:02:08.132774+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f938e984f37ddccf19a01e0681e64010ea7d10f8c7c7f4fcf66a8f11c20ab22b","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 10 of arXiv:2608.27500, 'Optimal Transport for Network Comparison: \\ A Review with Machine Learning Applications'] If $U^TU'=I+E$, with the spectral norm $\|E\|_2=\epsilon$, then
