{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:23:58.623224+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f9475df5b3e54f294f65c8694f83a9b35ad092baf2987d737599308586448b95","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 195 (Preliminary structure for the non-flat component of $\ehcurrent$ contracted with $\newuL$) of arXiv:2609.03101, 'The emergence of the Cauchy horizon from the crease for $3D$ compressible Euler flow'] The following identity holds for $\Sigma_t$-tangent vectorfields $\SigmatTan$:
