{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:46:26.257115+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f963aff399ebaf7529f0a141bed3dd2bdec5461c7e7222c3a6383441cc587006","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem 59 of arXiv:2605.23308, 'Convergence rate estimates for semigroups and heat kernels associated with resistance form'] For $f\in \BL^{\kappa}(M)$, define $g:M\to\R$ by $g=\overline{(G^{\alpha})^{\circ 2}f}$ 
