\Sigma
\right),
\end{equation}
and set \(
\accentset{\overline{\hphantom{L}}}{L}
_{t,s}=
\accentset{\overline{\hphantom{L}}}{L}
_{s,s}\) for \(t\ge s\). Then
\(\mathbb{G}^{
\accentset{\overline{\hphantom{L}}}{L}
}\in\mathcal{FG}_{\mathrm{mgle}}(T,d)\) solves
