{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T12:36:49.818573+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f9be22f85bde1fd34cfd4cc4e92716fb7dab90b6e1d7a6c1e5572cf6055a4e0e","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:reflection-increment of arXiv:2609.02829, 'Quantitative explosion and percolation of the divisible sandpile'] Suppose $(\zeta(x))_{x\in\mathbb{Z}^d}$ are i.i.d.\ with mean zero. Then $\mathbb{E} u_t(0)$
