{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T14:09:34.506930+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f9c3bd99072aad84a8a3de4a0edb29bd2d0558c44cf42211dacbf631fb65bdf7","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Conjecture Pure coulomb gas no spin of arXiv:2505.14762, 'Multiple radial SLE($\kappa$) and quantum Calogero-Sutherland system'] For irrational $\kappa \in(0,8)$, $\nu=n(\kappa)$ the pure partition functions are related to Coulomb gas integrals by affine meander matrix:
