{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T08:02:08.125805+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f9ca53269a8ae8cb35d1440b2aa00f50001a9947d1d5cb5bf5548b0042e493ae","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 26 of arXiv:2608.27433, 'Scalar curvature on K\"ahler blow-ups and systolic inequalities'] For every smooth function \(\Phi\in C^\infty(X)\),
