{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:46:26.251458+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_fa2f459daccd9c646dea8da8ae86cbfa22be59b286d52dd8ba7e272778b5f31b","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 9 of arXiv:2605.23222, 'On global solutions to the semidiscrete stochastic heat equation'] Let $\beta$ be so small that the conclusions of Theorems~\ref{thm:factorization} and~\ref{thm:continuous_Talagrand} hold. Then for $y$ fixed we have the following convergence statements:

