{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:25:12.189904+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_fa32b9d4d0305b6674eb1b00f68caf7bdb9d34cc75dc87b0527ba9747f799a10","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 35 of arXiv:2510.20492, 'Heterochromatic two-arm probabilities for metric graph Gaussian free fields'] For any $d\ge 3$, $v,w\in \widetilde{\mathbb{Z}}^d$ with $|v-w|\ge d$, and $0\le a,b\le |v-w|^{d-2}$, 
