{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T09:24:34.395731+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_fa4bef944265977e7645fdb9041fe73fc72c3ee2321af20a48083ff0152a0b53","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 7 of arXiv:2608.31008, 'Stability of gravitational instantons with a bounded Killing vector field'] Let $(M^4,g)$ be oriented Einstein with scalar curvature $s$.  If
