{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:17:17.086460+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_fa7dfcaf5352740c5273adc3f59b77494c5d02f782eb6a2dd7512b4119d0e8ee","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Conjecture 1 of arXiv:2608.19976, 'Random valuations'] Each locally finite $\sigma$-continuous valuation $\phi$ is
