{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T08:37:25.925602+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_fab64729d7a9aaf6d84d7bd77f8084dd56d5762245bb2d4cf9f3904ca99a628a","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 29 of arXiv:2608.29585, '2608.29585'] The interpolation-basis filtration on $\cZ_{n,\mathrm{fin}}$ is
