{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:32:29.000721+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_fabf555d4620cea3e5905936abbf926ecffa5e56c7e3de442c31f94447f4ebf4","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem CM mom LB of arXiv:2608.25471, 'Exact Hausdorff measures and fine geometry of collisions of independent Markov processes'] Fix $x_0 \in M$, $r \in (0, 1 \wedge r_*)$, and $n, N \in \mathbb{N}$ with $2n \leq N$ and $c_1 Nr^{d^{\mathrm{min}}_\mathrm{w}} < 1 \wedge t_*$.
