                    \item ${\mu}$ is a shift-ergodic measure. 
                \end{itemize}
            Assume that for some $k \in {\mathbb{N}}$, $k$-solitons exist with positive probability under ${\mu}$. Then, there exists some $v^{\mathrm{eff}}_{k} =v^{\mathrm{eff}}_k({\mu}) > 0$ such that 
