{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T08:22:48.904160+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_fda8370dff445e29a4c029c561f46d7745609da01066b89118b3fdacda2ea505","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 5 of arXiv:2608.29316, 'Powers of the Dirac Operator on $S^1\times S^{n-1}$'] The order $2k+1$ conformally covariant differential operator $A_{2k+1}$ on the spinor bundle over $M$,
