    \end{align*} (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T23:06:42.722090+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_fdbc72943d243085d00ab99a476f039ba02e0d823839f4a26b22e30e9418b0d6","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma cutoff of arXiv:2411.04157, 'Stochastic homogenization of dynamical discrete optimal transport'] Let $\tau,j_0,\alpha$ be as above. Let $U=\frac{\mathcal{L}^n}{\mathcal{L}^n(Q_{j_0,\alpha})}\in {\mathcal M}_+(\mathbb{R}^n)$
