\end{equation}","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T11:09:49.801203+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_fdd68b72cf64a8c3b715f4bbad57a4b56eb34864b20d4a090f058cc739188352","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 10 (Cf. Theorem 4.6, \cite{ab0}) of arXiv:2609.03070, 'Variants of order semicontinuity in Banach lattices'] The following conditions are equivalent:
