{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:19:46.237907+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_fddeec1afd138b1ce8945c9044f60d592df909148b2765da0db08e741ae128f1","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Cor 113 of arXiv:2507.08909, 'Annealed almost periodic entropy'] If $\phi:\G\to\rmM_k$ is positive definite, then $\hann(\phi)$ is equal to
	\begin{multline}
