{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:22:20.951946+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_fe1d1ed0bc838f8251ad6d8fb49a22476c856f1df0b143f3fc8aff947d2c6e26","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 7 of arXiv:2604.05234, 'Quantitative propagation of chaos and universality for asymmetric Langevin spin glass dyna'] Let $f:C([0,T],[-A,A]^{N})\to \R$ be a bounded function. Define
