{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T09:57:28.735208+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_fe2eae310b460ba5415c80f4b3a3f56838d42587e24579f6f56311c1fd55f6ab","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 1 ({[\citealp[Theorem~5.2) of arXiv:2609.01268, 'Resultant multiplicity via projective degrees\\ and applications to tensor eigenvalues'] {Roy-13};
