{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T10:25:49.871318+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_fe2f621e9e425cd4d0bea3b3b8d2454e9579133f2b8e61af584e769cf17699c3","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary 6 (\textsf{Stationary coalescence identity}) of arXiv:2609.02064, 'Coalescence and fluctuations of O'Connell--Yor polymers\\ via the free-energy correlation '] Fix $n\geq1$, $\be>0$, and $0\leq\wt x<x$.  Then
