{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T22:43:18.914483+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_feff220aaaec7c2307a37e8a50cf93eccd0b7712f325b6a07b638693051d38bd","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prop triple hodge formulas 1 of arXiv:2609.02409, 'Membranes and Maps'] For $n\in\{1,2,3\}$, we have
